  "prefLabel": "Adm 103.01 Requests for Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 103.01 Requests for Information. Consistent with RSA 91-A, information relating to the department is available for public inspection during normal working hours. Information that is available for public inspection may be copied at a cost of $.20 per page to be paid by the person requesting the information.\n\nSource. #7087, eff 8-31-99\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRule | Statute\n\nAdm 102.04 (a) | RSA 541-A: 16, I (a); RSA 21-I: 3-a; RSA 21-I: 6\n\nAdm 102.04 (e) | RSA 21-I: 7-b\n\nAdm 102.04 (f) | RSA 21-I; 4, VI; RSA 21-I: 7-c (Laws 2006, Ch. 70:2, 3 and 10)\n\nAdm 102.04 (g) | RSA 541-A: 16, I (a); RSA 21-I: 8\n\nAdm 102.04 (g) (2) a. 3. | RSA 541-A: 7, 8\n\nAdm 102.04 (h) | RSA 541-A: 16, I (a); RSA 21-I: 11, I (a); RSA 21-I: 12, I\n\nAdm 102.04 (h) (2) a. 2. (ii) | RSA 21-I: 12 I (e)\n\nAdm 102.04 (h) (2) e. | RSA 21-I: 12 V (Laws 2005, 291:7)\n\nAdm 102.04 (h) (2) f. | RSA 21-I: 12 VI (Laws 2005, 291:7)\n\nAdm 102.04 (i) | RSA 541-A: 16, I (a); RSA 21-I: 11, I (b); RSA 21-I:12, III\n\nAdm 102.04 (j) | RSA 541-A: 16, I (a); RSA 21-I: 11, I (c); RSA 21-I: 12, II",
